flowchart TB
    M[SDK Message in]:::msg

    M --> CHK{Message type?}

    CHK -->|SystemMessage| ST{subtype?}
    ST -->|init| EVT_SESSION[claude_session_created]
    ST -->|hook_*/task_*| DROP1[丢弃]:::drop

    CHK -->|StreamEvent| SE{event type?}
    SE -->|content_block_delta text| EVT_DELTA[claude_assistant_delta]
    SE -->|content_block_delta thinking| EVT_TDELTA[claude_assistant_thinking_delta]
    SE -->|other| DROP2[丢弃]:::drop

    CHK -->|AssistantMessage| AM{block type?}
    AM -->|TextBlock| EVT_FINAL[claude_assistant_final]
    AM -->|ThinkingBlock| EVT_TFINAL[claude_assistant_thinking_final]
    AM -->|ToolUseBlock| EVT_TOOL_S[claude_tool_started]

    CHK -->|UserMessage with ToolResultBlock| TR{tool_use_id 在 deny 集合中?}
    TR -->|是| DROP3[丢弃 - E8 去重]:::drop
    TR -->|否| EVT_TOOL_F[claude_tool_finished]

    CHK -->|ResultMessage| RM{stop_reason / is_error?}
    RM -->|stop_reason=interrupted| EVT_INT[claude_run_interrupted]
    RM -->|is_error=True| EVT_FAIL[claude_run_failed]
    RM -->|else| EVT_DONE[claude_run_finished + usage]

    EVT_SESSION --> OUT[Output Writer]
    EVT_DELTA --> OUT
    EVT_TDELTA --> OUT
    EVT_FINAL --> OUT
    EVT_TFINAL --> OUT
    EVT_TOOL_S --> OUT
    EVT_TOOL_F --> OUT
    EVT_INT --> OUT
    EVT_FAIL --> OUT
    EVT_DONE --> OUT

    classDef msg fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100
    classDef drop fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-dasharray:3 3
    style OUT fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32
